=====Usage notes=====
In simplified Chinese, {{l|zh|馀}} is a non-standard form of {{lang|zh|餘}} only used as a surname or when it is desirable to distinguish {{lang|zh|餘}} from {{l|zh|余}}. {{lang|zh|馀}} was formerly official in {{lang|zh|简化字总表}} (1964); this character was removed in {{lang|zh|通用规范汉字表}} (2013).

In traditional Chinese, the surnames {{zh-l|*餘}} and {{zh-l|*余}} are distinct, with the latter being much more common among the population.

