Compound of {{ja-com|sort=やかた|屋|や|t1=[[house]], [[hut]], [[structure]]|形|かた|t2=[[shape]], [[form]]}}.<ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref><ref name="DJR">{{R:Daijirin}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
{{ja-pron|やかた|acc=0|acc_ref=DJR,SMK7}}

====Noun====
{{ja-noun|やかた}}

# a [[roofed]] [[structure]] on a [[boat]], shaped like a [[house]]
# a [[house]]-shaped structure on a [[cart]], such as a [[caravan]]
# a [[temporary]] [[house]], a temporary [[shelter]]
# a [[mansion]], a [[manor]] [[house]], an [[estate]]
# {{lb|ja|sort=やかた|honorific|archaic}} a form of address or reference for a [[noble]]
# {{clipping of|ja|sort=やかた|屋形船|tr=yakata-bune}}: a [[houseboat]]

